{"about":{
  "part": "SZYTF OV9281 camera module, 79 deg lens (drawing WX-1M-9281-79-V1.0). Off-board module: 3D model only, for the espion-cam enclosure assembly.",
  "frame": "Origin on the optical axis at the PCB's lens-side surface; +Z toward the scene (lens direction); X along the 25 mm edge; the FFC connector edge toward -Y. The PCB spans Z -1.6..0, the lens tops out at Z 5.5, the back pads at Z -1.635.",
  "sources": [
   "Mechanical drawing WX-1M-9281-79-V1.0 (listing image https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sc05f84c44d8340139f90cdb8f6d23030K.jpg)",
   "Product photo, front and back (https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S55ea7644d5a34637b0eb6633bdcac8e03.jpg_960x960q75.jpg_.avif)",
   "Listing https://fr.aliexpress.com/item/1005012566040263.html"
  ],
  "estimates": "Parameters whose comment says 'estimate' are not dimensioned on the drawing: scaled from the drawing (19 px/mm) or the photo (15 px/mm). Small SMD parts are left out.",
  "rebuild": "solidcraft-cli run hardware/lib/3d-src/SZYTF_OV9281_WX-1M-9281-79.json --out hardware/lib/Module_SZYTF.3dshapes/SZYTF_OV9281_WX-1M-9281-79.step"
 },
